WEBVTT

00:33:26.023 --> 00:33:31.366
then maybe I will get a chance to explore
what's really my passion."

00:33:31.390 --> 00:33:35.606
Carmen saw an opportunity
to earn some idiosyncrasy credit.

00:33:35.630 --> 00:33:37.996
By demonstrating her value in the new job,

00:33:38.020 --> 00:33:42.406
she could show that she was aligned
with the CIA's core values.

00:33:42.430 --> 00:33:43.601
CM: And we nailed it.

00:33:43.625 --> 00:33:48.896
I think that that really
restored or changed

00:33:48.920 --> 00:33:50.736
the organization's view of me

00:33:50.760 --> 00:33:54.806
and restored it as a much more
competent person.

00:33:54.830 --> 00:33:58.276
And I now had authority and status.

00:33:58.300 --> 00:34:02.496
And so, people were much more
receptive to my ideas.